        or stepped on by crowd or human stampede, occurrence at industrial and construction area;
        220882004) is the place-level equivalent; activity dimension is dropped. Target subsumes the
        source (one-level broader). High tier: place-level literal match, unspecified activity is not a
        semantic loss.
        """
}
